    "summary": "A woman&#039;s sleeveless sheepskin waistcoat.  Centre front opening.  Two tones of brown coloured fleece on the inside.  Multicoloured wool embroidery on cream-coloured leather on the outside, including a line of framed circular motifs, bands of diagonal embroidery, straight and meandering linked leaf motifs, and small applied pom poms.  Solid black wool embroidered bands at the hem, armholes, neckline and centre front.  Fastened with three leather &#039;toggles&#039; with pom poms and loops.",
